{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_035_convirt-title\">ConVIRT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">将自然生成的医学图像–报告对输入全局双塔，通过双向跨模态对比预训练医学视觉 encoder。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Pretrains medical visual encoders directly from naturally occurring paired radiology images and free-text reports via bidirectional contrastive loss.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">医学图像与配套自由文本报告</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Paired medical image (e.g., chest X-ray) and corresponding clinical radiology report sentence</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">对齐的图像与报告全局表征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Contrastively aligned visual encoder representation for downstream low-label classification</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.6</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v182/zhang22a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_035_convirt')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_035_convirt')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"ConVIRT original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/9ff64cdd9108214ecc83.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.6</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_035_convirt\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_035_convirt')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_035_convirt\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">医学图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">放射影像经随机视觉增强送入图像分支。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests paired medical image (e.g., chest x-ray) and corresponding clinical radiology report sentence and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"放射影像经随机视觉增强送入图像分支。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests paired medical image (e.g., chest x-ray) and corresponding clinical radiology report sentence and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"医学图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">医学图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">放射影像经随机视觉增强送入图像分支。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests paired medical image (e.g., chest x-ray) and corresponding clinical radiology report sentence and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"卷积主干与全局池化提取整幅影像表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Image Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">卷积主干与全局池化提取整幅影像表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"MLP/线性头将影像特征投影并归一化到共享空间。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"图像投影\" data-node-name-en=\"projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">MLP/线性头将影像特征投影并归一化到共享空间。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与图像同期生成的自然语言报告提供无人工标签监督。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Radiology Report within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"放射报告\" data-node-name-en=\"Radiology Report\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">放射报告</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Radiology Report</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与图像同期生成的自然语言报告提供无人工标签监督。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Radiology Report within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"BERT 类编码器将 token 序列聚合为报告级语义向量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Text Encoder within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Text Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Text Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Text Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">BERT 类编码器将 token 序列聚合为报告级语义向量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Text Encoder within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"报告表示投影并归一化到与图像相同维度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"文本投影\" data-node-name-en=\"projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">文本投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">报告表示投影并归一化到与图像相同维度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"mini-batch 内所有图像与报告两两计算相似度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs cross-modal matrix within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"跨模态相似矩阵\" data-node-name-en=\"cross-modal matrix\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">跨模态相似矩阵</span><span class=\"lang-en\">cross-modal matrix</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">mini-batch 内所有图像与报告两两计算相似度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs cross-modal matrix within the core medical image report dual encoder contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"图像检索报告和报告检索图像两个方向共同优化。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"双向对比损失\" data-node-name-en=\"loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双向对比损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像检索报告和报告检索图像两个方向共同优化。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"丢弃训练投影头后，图像 encoder 可微调到分类等医学任务。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces contrastively aligned visual encoder representation for downstream low-label classification via feature.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"下游影像特征\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_035_convirt', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">下游影像特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">丢弃训练投影头后，图像 encoder 可微调到分类等医学任务。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces contrastively aligned visual encoder representation for downstream low-label classification via feature.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"ConVIRT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 医学图像与报告的双向对比对齐</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Bidirectional Medical Image-to-Report &amp; Report-to-Image Contrastive Objective</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"ConVIRT：核心公式 · 医学图像与报告的双向对比对齐\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"35\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.285421pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.079189 330.542119 25.285421\" width=\"330.542119pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m035_g7-0\"></path><path d=\"M6.970228-1.869354L5.550099-3.347448L5.325486-3.108345L6.187708-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H6.187708L5.325486-.615873L5.550099-.376769L6.970228-1.869354Z\" id=\"m035_g7-33\"></path><path d=\"M5.376205-.485452L5.339977-.557908C5.028418-.217367 4.571948 0 4.108232 0C3.318466 0 2.557682-.239103 1.804144-.434734C2.59391-1.137553 3.043135-1.934564 3.217028-2.977925C3.303975-3.521342 3.383676-4.753087 4.14446-4.753087C4.463265-4.753087 4.738596-4.637158 4.738596-4.27488C4.738596-4.129969 4.66614-3.992303 4.564702-3.890865V-3.811164C4.738596-3.869129 5.30375-4.129969 5.30375-4.34009C5.30375-4.803806 4.702368-4.99219 4.325599-4.99219C2.347561-4.99219 2.470736-2.941697 2.086721-1.557795C2.021511-1.311446 1.68097-.543417 1.383902-.543417C1.181026-.543417 .985396-.623118 .78252-.623118C.514435-.623118 .152157-.094192 .050719 .123175L.086947 .173893C.210121 .072456 .39126-.043473 .557908-.043473C1.782408-.043473 2.905469 .623118 4.129969 .623118C4.869016 .623118 5.158838 .144911 5.376205-.485452Z\" id=\"m035_g7-76\"></path><path d=\"M.449225 1.398393H.825994L2.883733-5.122611H2.506964L.449225 1.398393Z\" id=\"m035_g7-157\"></path><path d=\"M2.064984-2.101212H.449225V-1.623005H2.064984V0H2.543191V-1.623005H4.158951V-2.101212H2.543191V-3.724218H2.064984V-2.101212Z\" id=\"m035_g7-184\"></path><path d=\"M2.13744-5.195066C1.086834-4.513984 .347787-3.340203 .347787-1.862109C.347787-.514435 1.115816 .84773 2.115703 1.463603L2.20265 1.347674C1.246236 .594136 .970905-.282577 .970905