se><use x=\"76.553022\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-186\" y=\"-48.38361\"></use><use x=\"80.368698\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-157\" y=\"-48.38361\"></use><use x=\"85.081022\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g16-103\" y=\"-48.38361\"></use><use x=\"90.161969\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-186\" y=\"-48.38361\"></use><use x=\"95.173088\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g16-150\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"119.55826\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-76\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"127.219521\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g20-67\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"132.070431\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g20-111\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"135.706796\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g20-110\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"139.343161\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g20-86\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"144.594073\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g20-73\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"147.015894\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g20-82\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"151.61225\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g20-84\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"159.321307\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g1-61\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"168.295366\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g16-95\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"174.008937\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-76\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"181.961107\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g13-30\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"185.27383\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g7-33\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"192.648378\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g13-41\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"200.458522\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-184\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"209.506758\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-185\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"213.222818\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g23-49\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"220.418004\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-0\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"228.838596\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g16-95\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"234.35291\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-186\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"238.367843\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g10-76\" y=\"-55.217966\"></use><use x=\"245.956375\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g13-41\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"251.054549\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g7-33\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use><use x=\"258.792735\" xlink:href=\"#m035_g13-30\" y=\"-53.723585\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">ImageNet 或纯图像 SSL 对医学高类间相似度与临床语义帮助有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">ImageNet pretraining struggled with subtle gray-scale radiographic findings, while rule-based report labelers (CheXpert) lost clinical nuance.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">对配对医学影像与报告做双向全局对比学习</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Use naturally co-occurring clinical radiology reports as free-form weak supervision via bidirectional image–text contrastive learning.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用自然语言报告作为弱监督，并展示少标签迁移</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Domain-specific image and clinical text dual towers trained with symmetric InfoNCE, achieving strong label efficiency with 1%–10% labels.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">奠定医学 CLIP 式胸片表示学习</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pioneered the medical CLIP paradigm before or alongside general-domain CLIP, establishing report-supervised radiology pretraining.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">医学图文对齐 landmark；局部定位能力有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Landmark medical VLM foundation; global pooling captures study-level semantics but remains coarse for tiny focal lesions.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">利用影像–报告的天然配对，把临床工作流文本变成大规模弱监督而无需逐图人工标签。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">双向批内对比要求匹配图文靠近、非匹配样本分离，从而学习报告语义可辨的视觉空间。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">训练投影空间与下游表征分离，使对比几何约束不必完全承担临床任务接口。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Use naturally co-occurring clinical radiology reports as free-form weak supervision via bidirectional image–text contrastive learning.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Domain-specific image and clinical text dual towers trained with symmetric InfoNCE, achieving strong label efficiency with 1%–10% labels.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Bidirectional Medical Image-to-Report &amp; Report-to-Image Contrastive Objective.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">报告常省略正常所见、包含比较历史或否定语句，图文配对不是像素级真值。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">患者级划分和同检查多图处理是必要 QA，否则相近图像/报告会造成数据泄漏或假负样本。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Pioneered the medical CLIP paradigm before or alongside general-domain CLIP, establishing report-supervised radiology pretraining.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Landmark medical VLM foundation; global pooling captures study-level semantics but remains coarse for tiny focal lesions.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v182/zhang22a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Contrastive Learning of Medical Visual Representations from Paired Images and Text</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<span class=\"spec-muted-val\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">未提供官方实现</span><span class=\"lang-en\">No Official Repository</span></span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
